          {"id":"rr002txt","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p style=\"color:#888;font-size:14px;text-align:right;\">Last Updated: <strong>[DATE]</strong></p>\n<p>At Burans Valley, we stand behind every jar we dispatch. Because ghee is a food product, our return window is limited — but if something is wrong, we will make it right.</p>\n<h2>1. What We Accept for Return / Replacement</h2>\n<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:15px;\"><tr style=\"background:#faf7f4;\"><th style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #e0d5c8;text-align:left;\">Situation</th><th style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #e0d5c8;text-align:left;\">Resolution</th><th style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #e0d5c8;text-align:left;\">Time Limit</th></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #e0d5c8;\">Product arrived physically damaged (broken seal, cracked jar)</td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #e0d5c8;\">Full replacement or refund</td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #e0d5c8;\"><strong>48 hours</strong></td></tr><tr style=\"background:#faf7f4;\"><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #e0d5c8;\">Wrong product received</td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #e0d5c8;\">Full replacement + free pickup</td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #e0d5c8;\"><strong>48 hours</strong></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #e0d5c8;\">Quality concern (off smell, texture)</td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #e0d5c8;\">Case-by-case; replacement where verified</td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #e0d5c8;\"><strong>48 hours</strong></td></tr></table>\n<h2>2. What We Cannot Accept</h2><ul><li>Opened or partially used products (food-safety reasons), unless a genuine quality defect.</li><li>Returns initiated more than 48 hours after delivery.</li><li>Change-of-mind returns.</li><li>Damage caused by improper storage after delivery.</li></ul>\n<h2>3. How to Raise a Request</h2><ol><li>Contact us at <strong>[EMAIL]</strong> or WhatsApp <strong>[WHATSAPP]</strong> within 48 hours of delivery.</li><li>Share your <strong>Order ID</strong> and <strong>clear photographs</strong> of the damaged or incorrect item and packaging.</li><li>We will respond within <strong>24 business hours</strong>.</li><li>For eligible returns, we arrange a free reverse pickup or confirm disposal instructions.</li></ol>\n<h2>4. Refund Process</h2><ul><li>Approved refunds go to your original payment method.</li><li>Refunds appear within <strong>5–7 business days</strong> after confirmation.</li><li>COD orders: refunds via bank transfer — provide account details with your request.</li></ul>\n<h2>5. Cancellations</h2><ul><li>You may cancel <strong>before dispatch</strong> — email <strong>[EMAIL]</strong> immediately with your Order ID.</li><li>Once dispatched, cancellation is not possible — raise a return request after delivery.</li><li>We may cancel orders in case of stock issues, payment failure, or fraud — full refund provided.</li></ul>\n<h2>6. Questions?</h2><p>Email <strong>[EMAIL]</strong> or see our <a href=\"/grievance-redressal\" style=\"color:#6b3e26;\">Grievance Redressal page</a>.</p>","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":16,"sizes":[]},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.8,"sizes":[]}}}
        ]
